# Signing key material. The updater private key can sign anything the app will
# install, and the Developer ID private key can sign anything as Toki. Neither
# belongs in a repository, least of all a public one. These live outside the
# repo; this is the second line of defence, and scripts/app-updates.test.mjs is
# the third.
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
!*.key.pub

